WEBVTT

00:12:29.818 --> 00:12:32.004
I never assumed that I could,
but I thought,

00:12:32.028 --> 00:12:35.535
still, I'm going to organize
my entire life around this hobby,

00:12:35.559 --> 00:12:37.564
because this is what I need to do.

00:12:37.588 --> 00:12:40.882
CA: And so presumably you look back
now on that day, on that moment,

00:12:40.906 --> 00:12:42.828
as, "Thank goodness that happened."

00:12:42.852 --> 00:12:44.230
SC: (Laughs) Yes. Yeah.

00:12:44.254 --> 00:12:46.279
Because, the environments that we live in

00:12:46.303 --> 00:12:48.977
tend to be emotionally
kind of hermetically sealed,

00:12:49.001 --> 00:12:53.297
and you don't even realize how much you're
operating within that little bubble.

00:12:53.321 --> 00:12:55.561
During the time
I was practicing corporate law

00:12:55.585 --> 00:12:57.555
and I was starting to get really unhappy,

00:12:57.579 --> 00:12:59.388
it was maybe three or four years in,

00:12:59.412 --> 00:13:01.030
and I came across this book.